{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "title": "Dimming actuator: switching, relative, and absolute dimming",
  "description": "A short press switches the lamp on or off; a long press dims it with DPT 3.007 until the key is released. The numeric field sends an absolute level with DPT 5.001. The actuator reports its switching state and its level after each change.",
